  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU contribution to the African Legal Support Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim of the project is to support the activities of the Medium Term Strategy of the African Legal Facility. The specific objective of the Facility is to enhance legal capacity in Africa both in contracting and litigation in particular in the area of extractive industries and related infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
